workspace/skills/kidney-cancer-detector/scripts/kidney_cancer_tool.py:99:    result = call_endpoint_from_image_path(args.image_path, timeout=args.timeout)\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/skills/kidney-cancer-detector/SKILL.md:2:name: kidney-cancer-detection\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/skills/kidney-cancer-detector/SKILL.md:3:description: Use this skill when the user wants to analyze a kidney medical image for possible kidney cancer detection, classify the result, or route an image to a kidney cancer prediction endpoint using a local or remote inference service.\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/skills/kidney-cancer-detector/SKILL.md:8:      - kidney\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/skills/kidney-cancer-detector/SKILL.md:15:This skill helps analyze a kidney medical image by:\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/skills/kidney-cancer-detector/SKILL.md:18:- sending it to a kidney cancer detection endpoint\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/skills/kidney-cancer-detector/SKILL.md:25:- wants to run kidney cancer detection on a medical image\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/skills/kidney-cancer-detector/SKILL.md:27:- asks to call a kidney cancer inference endpoint\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/skills/kidney-cancer-detector/SKILL.md:28:- wants a wrapper script for kidney cancer prediction\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/skills/kidney-cancer-detector/SKILL.md:32:- the user only wants general educational information about kidney cancer\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/skills/kidney-cancer-detector/SKILL.md:46:- `image_path`: path to the image file to analyze\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/skills/kidney-cancer-detector/SKILL.md:51:python3 kidney_cancer_tool.py /path/to/image.png\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/skills/pipeline-generator/SKILL.md:3:description: Generate an ML pipeline prototype by sending a user prompt to http://looporchestra.sytes.net:4010/nodes/ai_tool/AutoGen-model and reading the returned Answer field. Use only when the user explicitly asks for an ML pipeline proto